      <p>Thirty annual conferences in Washington and others in San Diego, Detroit, New Jersey, Great Britain, and Constantinople. More than 500 audio and video recordings, 300 of them free on YouTube. Three Seminary Concert Tours from Eastern Europe. Four ecumenical pilgrimages with private audiences at the Vatican and the Phanar. A special campaign for Ukraine, delivered in person to Archbishop Borys Gudziak.</p>
